# UI & UX standards

## Visual & navigation

- Dark navy surfaces with one accent color.
- Large touch targets suitable for Android gym-floor use.
- Bottom tabs: Dashboard, Members, Attendance, Payments, Settings.
- Shared theme tokens (colors, spacing, typography); no one-off magic values.

## States & safety

- Every screen handles loading, empty, error, and success states.
- Confirmation before destructive or financial actions.
- Accessible labels and sufficient contrast.

## Forms

- Zod validation on all forms before submit.
